        "original_id": "95f10488-5742-5c55-aca2-12f092a451cf",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Grazia, JJ, Love Berry\n- People: Lucy Atkins, Shuuka Fujii\n- Companies: Kobunsha\n- Places: Italy, Japan, Osaka Prefecture, Albania, Bahrain, Bulgaria, China, Croatia, France, Germany\n- Organizations: E-girls, Flower, ShuuKaRen\n- Roles: journalist, literary critic, dancer, fashion model, actress, singer\n\nFacts:\n- Grazia is a weekly women's magazine that originated in Italy.\n- Grazia has international editions printed in Albania, Bahrain, Bulgaria, China, Croatia, France, and Germany.\n- JJ is a Japanese fashion and lifestyle magazine published by Kobunsha.\n- Lucy Atkins has a background in journalism and is a literary critic for The Sunday Times.\n- Lucy Atkins has written for UK newspapers and magazines including The Guardian, The Times, The Sunday Times, The Telegraph, Psychologies, Red, Woman & Home, and Grazia.\n- Shuuka Fujii was born on 14 October 1994 in Osaka Prefecture, Japan.\n- Shuuka Fujii is a Japanese dancer, fashion model, actress, and singer.\n- Shuuka Fujii is a member of E-girls, Flower, and ShuuKaRen.\n- Shuuka Fujii is an exclusive model for JJ and Love Berry.",
